<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>ION Reference App</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #080d1e;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 640px; width: 100%; text-align: center; }
  .wordmark { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0; }
  .wordmark span { font-weight: 400; color: #94a3b8; }
  .ribbon {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    background: #f97316;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .tagline { margin: 22px 0 36px; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .buttons { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
  .btn {
    flex: 1 1 220px;
    max-width: 260px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    color: #ffffff;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  }
  .btn:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); }
  .btn .role { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .btn.buyer .role { color: #34d399; }
  .btn.seller .role { color: #38bdf8; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="wordmark">ION <span>Reference App</span></p>
    <span class="ribbon">This is the reference app for ION network managed by remiges technologies pvt. ltd.</span>
    <p class="tagline">A working demo of the Beckn Protocol — a buyer app and a seller app that discover, quote, and transact with each other purely through an open network protocol.</p>
    <div class="buttons">
      <a class="btn buyer" href="${BAP_URL}">
        <span class="role">Buyer app (BAP)</span>
        Enter as Buyer
      </a>
      <a class="btn seller" href="${BPP_URL}">
        <span class="role">Seller app (BPP)</span>
        Enter as Seller
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
